\item[S2] Yuanan Diao, Claus Ernst, Attila Por and Uta Ziegler, The Ropelengths of Knots Are Almost Linear in Terms of Their Crossing Numbers (2009), v1; arXiv:0912.3282. \url{https://arxiv.org/pdf/0912.3282}.
